### Status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/status


### Start session
POST http://localhost:5000/api/session/start
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### Speak current section
POST http://localhost:5000/api/debrief/speak


### Next section
POST http://localhost:5000/api/debrief/next


### Ask integrated question
POST http://localhost:5000/api/question
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How do my DISC style, Driving Forces, and EQ work together in my family role?"
}


### Repeat section
POST http://localhost:5000/api/debrief/repeat


### Restart debrief
POST http://localhost:5000/api/debrief/restart


### Test DISC narrative through Tavus
POST http://localhost:5000/api/dev/disc-narrative

### End session
POST http://localhost:5000/api/session/end

### Dismiss question mode (no API call, resumes narration)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/question/dismiss


### Keep question mode open (restarts the timeout, e.g. while typing)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/question/keepalive


### Typed dismissal through the question route (no API call)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/question
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Never mind, please continue."
}


### Push-to-talk: send one recorded utterance (interrupts, transcribes, answers or dismisses)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/voice/audio
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample-question.wav
